Template: vaststats/api-key
Type: password
Description: Vast API key:
 Enter a restricted Vast API key for machine reads and telemetry access.
 The key is stored locally in /etc/vaststats/vaststats.env and is never
 included in the package or dashboard responses.
 .
 Leave blank to keep an existing key or configure it later with
 "sudo dpkg-reconfigure vaststats". Without a key the dashboard runs
 without collecting data.
